# Host turns (src/turn-launch.ts TURN_SLICE) and ultra reviews run here; since #1280 lands, kit-sync and fast-verify
# run beside it in citadel-builds.slice. Both are under
# citadel.slice (MemoryMax=22G for everything Citadel runs). MemoryHigh makes the kernel reclaim from and
# throttle these before they crowd out the server and the containers (2026-11-10: load ~100 with 19 GiB
# swapped out). Measured 2026-11-19/20 (#1214): host turns up to 1.1G each; on 2026-11-20 18 turns at 350-650M
# plus one land filled 10G and stalled (#1280). Whether to raise it is Josh's call after a week of storm records.
# No MemoryMax on purpose: it would OOM-kill turns. citadel.slice's MemoryMax is the hard stop. Container
# turns carry their own caps on their unit (src/claude-link.ts CONTAINER_MEMORY).
[Unit]
Description=Host turns of Citadel

[Slice]
MemoryHigh=10G
